# Combat

## Bow ([`src/combat/bow.js`](src/combat/bow.js))

- Authored `bow.glb` on LeftHand after `avatar.prepareSkeleton()`.
- Look = camera `getLookDir` (crosshair). Equip on first shot; visible while `_busy === 'draw'`.
- **Aim parallax (OTS):** do not fire parallel to look from an offset muzzle. `releaseShot(lookDir, cameraPos)` aims at a point on the look ray ~`AIM_AHEAD` past the muzzle’s depth along that ray, then fires `normalize(aimPoint − muzzle)`.
- Wire `avatar.getCameraPos` from the camera rig.
- Base shoot volume ~`0.28`. After **5** released shots → **`0.35×` base** (quieter for long sessions).

## Arrows ([`src/combat/arrows.js`](src/combat/arrows.js))

- Pool of **10** `arrow.glb` — flight + stuck (FIFO recycle). Tip authored −Z → `_tipFix` yaw; plant mid-shaft with ~`PENETRATE`.
- Giant plant: snap to `GIANT_BODY_R`, then **`attachToBone`** nearest body bone (not root).
- Cyclops / Antinous / sheep: plant at body radius + bone attach when skinned.
- Pillar plant: detect `hitRadius`, plant at tighter `surfaceRadius`; parent to pillar; `arrow_impact_pillar.mp3`.
- Ground plant: world-space stuck in sand.
- Hit order: ground → **sheep** → giant → **cyclops** → antinous → pillar.

## Headshots

- Zone from impact local Y (+ facing for giant/cyclops). Play `headshot.mp3` on `"head"` (cyclops plays it in `playHit`).
- **Giant / Cyclops:** face band only (front + head height). Back hits stay `"back"`.
- **Antinous:** head band from **any** facing (`localY >= ANTI_HEAD_Y` / `a.headY`).

## SFX ([`src/combat/sfx.js`](src/combat/sfx.js))

- `preloadSfx` / `playSfx` / `unlockAudio` — Web Audio buffer pool.
- Trim leading silence so impact timing matches ballistics / melee window.
- Mono ~22 kHz / 64 kbps MP3 is enough — see `assets-policy`.
